==================================================
           AURASCRIPT LANGUAGE MANUAL
==================================================

1. COMPILATION INSTRUCTIONS
--------------------------------------------------
To build the AuraScript interpreter from source:
    bison -d parser.y
    flex lexer.l
    gcc parser.tab.c lex.yy.c -o aura -lm

2. EXECUTION INSTRUCTIONS
--------------------------------------------------
Run an AuraScript program:
    ./aura < examples/demo.aura

3. SYNTAX GUIDE
--------------------------------------------------
* Variable Declaration: let variable_name = value;
* Print Statement: print "Hello"; or print variable_name;
* Conditionals: if (x > 5) { ... } and unless (x == 0) { ... }
